      "value": "Even at the lowest possible resolution you may be able to obtain within VRChat's game engine, Unity, you are much more likely to be CPU bottlenecked, this issue is a unfortunate consequence of the minimum spec-requirements for VRChat to be playable on VR, and the limitations of an integrated graphics card.",
