  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-03-02T04:13:35.630Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Could you add these? I sometimes get unplayable frame rates in PCVR on PlutoSphere, and often on my iGPU. My iGPU is on the lowest I can set it besides render resolution most of the time, and it’s usually playable. But in heavy worlds, it’s never playable.\nCustom settings would help a lot for that.\nLowest would mean bare minimum needed to see avatars and the world and such.\nThanks for considering this idea if you do!",
